--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Description:
This library implements the DeepStream metadata structures shared by every
plugin and application. It provides the acquire, release, copy and transform
operations for the batch, frame, object, classifier, display, audio and user
metadata types, and the metadata pool that recycles them so that metadata can be
attached to buffers without per frame allocation.
Refer to the DeepStream SDK documentation for more details.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Compiling and installing the library:

  $ sudo make (sudo not required in case of docker containers)
  $ sudo make install (sudo not required in case of docker containers)

The library libnvds_meta.so is installed at
/opt/nvidia/deepstream/deepstream/lib/
